# md5 of every input of banks/subrole_g3 (md5sum format; `md5sum -c CODE.md5` from banks/subrole_g3/, or python banks/make_role_banks.py).
# subrole_g3.py also reads ../subrole/ (clean/*.json, seeds/), md5-pinned inside it (STAMPED_PIN).
# subrole_g3.py differs from the project's copy in two comment / status-string rewordings (no person's name, no cluster
# name) and in one pin, STAMPED_SUBROLE_PY_MD5, which names this repo's reworded ../subrole/subrole.py (05446a45; the
# project's 3fb169ad), so that its selftest's source-identity check runs (71/71). The rows in SHIP_SUBROLE_G3.md5 are the project's.
